    {
      "dot": "emerald", "title": "Capture contract",
      "items": [
        "Always answers 200; a storage failure is logged, never surfaced",
        "Body read up to 1 MiB, flagged truncated beyond that",
        "Oldest rows pruned past 1,000 requests per webhook",
        "Each capture bumps lastActivityAt, pushing back expiry"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose", "title": "Trust boundary",
      "items": [
        "No accounts: the webhook UUID in the URL is the only key",
        "Create limit 20/min/IP is in-memory per instance and off by default",
        "Optional per-IP active-webhook quota (WEBHOOK_QUOTA)",
        "UI forwarder overwrites X-Forwarded-For and drops x-real-ip / forwarded",
        "Forwarder only calls WEBHOOK_API_URL; unreachable API returns 502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan", "title": "Two runtimes",
      "items": [
        "Node / Docker: SQLite file, schema ensured on first use, hourly setInterval purge",
        "Cloudflare Workers: D1 via env.DB, migrations at deploy, cron 0 * * * *",
        "Driver chosen by probing the Cloudflare context, not NEXT_RUNTIME"
      ]
    },
